        <Param val="Welcome!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In each trial you’ll see two images side by side. Your task is to decide whether they’re Similar or Not Similar.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mouse: click the “Similar” or “Not Similar” button&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Keyboard: press → for Similar, ← for Not Similar&amp;#10;&amp;#10;When you’re ready, press SPACE (desktop) or tap anywhere on the screen (mobile) to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
